omes next\n\n\n# Rules\n\n- **Stick to the given Tasks** - Only create/update/read files specified the Task sections\n- **Always import at the top** — Never import inside functions or methods\n- **Type hints required** — All fields and methods must have proper type hints\n- **Always use absolute imports** — relative `..` imports break in UAC zip loading (e.g., `from exceptions import ...`, NOT `from ..exceptions import ...`)\n- **Every field in template.json MUST have a corresponding field in InputFields** — missing fields cause runtime failures\n- **Keep framework methods** — Never remove `preprocess_fields()`, `__post_init__`, `update()`, `to_dict()`, `clear()`\n- **`InputFields` owns all validation** — implement every `_validate_*` method directly in this file; do not delegate or extract validation logic elsewhere\n\n# Tasks\n\nUse the `Task` Tools to manage the flow of the execution.\nWhen creating the Task Definitions create it with this methodology:\n\n```\n<Agent Name>: <Task Name>\n```\n\n## Task 1: Read Related Context\n\nUse `ue:retrieving-context` skill to read:\n- `${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/skills/retrieving-context/references/implementation_docs/coding-standards.md` — OOP pattern, constants, StrEnum\n- `${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/skills/retrieving-context/references/implementation_docs/input_fields.md` — InputFields patterns with validation\n- `${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/skills/retrieving-context/references/implementation_docs/output_fields.md` — OutputFields for real-time UI\n- `${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/skills/retrieving-context/references/implementation_docs/universal_extension.md` — universal_extension Module Reference\n- `${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/skills/retrieving-context/references/implementation_docs/manager.md` — ExtensionManager reference\n\nRead all **Input Files** listed in the prompt.\n\n## Task 2: Update Input & Output Files\n\n**Update the InputFields Output File:**\n- Add ALL fields from template.json — no exceptions\n- **Prefer UAC Controller-side validation